        "title": "Equivalent fractions",
        "text": "Fractional equivalence tells us that $$\\frac{a}{b}=\\frac{c}{d}$$ if and only if $$b$$ and $$d$$ are nonzero and $$ad=bc$$.",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a6dd06fA131-fracequiv-P10b-h2",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a6dd06fA131-fracequiv-P10b-h1"
        ],
        "title": "Equivalent fractions",
        "text": "Here we get \\n $$\\frac{3}{x}=\\frac{x}{3}$$ \\n if and only if $$9=x^2$$.",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a6dd06fA131-fracequiv-P10b-h3",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a6dd06fA131-fracequiv-P10b-h2"
        ],
        "title": "Subtract $$9$$ from both sides",
        "text": "$$0=x^2-9$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a6dd06fA131-fracequiv-P10b-h4",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a6dd06fA131-fracequiv-P10b-h3"
        ],
        "title": "Difference of squares",
        "text": "The right hand side is a difference of squares and can be factored as $$\\left(x-3\\right) \\left(x+3\\right)$$.",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a6dd06fA131-fracequiv-P10b-h5",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a6dd06fA131-fracequiv-P10b-h4"
        ],
        "title": "Zero product property",
        "text": "The zero product property says that $$x^2-9=\\left(x-3\\right) \\left(x+3\\right)=0$$ if and only if $$x-3=0$$ or $$x+3=0$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a6dd06fA131-fracequiv-P10b-h6",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a6dd06fA131-fracequiv-P10b-h5"
        ],
        "title": "Solve the equations",
        "text": "$$x-3=0$$ or $$x+3=0$$ if $$x=\\pm 3$$.",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    }
